.TH MYGREP 3 "2024" "libmyutils 0.4.1" "Library Functions Manual"
.SH NAME
mygrep \- search a file for lines containing a pattern
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
#include "myfilefunctions.h"
int mygrep(FILE *fp, const char *search_str, char **matches);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mygrep
reads the file stream
.I fp
line by line and stores copies of any line containing the substring
.I search_str
into the caller-provided
.I matches
array. The caller is responsible for freeing each returned line.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of matched lines, or -1 on failure.
